00:00:17.147 --> 00:00:19.323 position:63%
that idea, that a computer just,

00:00:19.424 --> 00:00:22.101 position:63%
you press a button and you get this billion

00:00:22.101 --> 00:00:24.657 position:63%
line long proof of the Riemann hypothesis

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:27.274 position:63%
and it's just like, let A be this function,

00:00:27.374 --> 00:00:29.624 position:63%
let B be this function, let C be this number,

00:00:29.674 --> 00:00:32.465 position:63%
let D be this function. It's just like pages

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:35.256 position:63%
and pages but like no explanation of why any

00:00:35.256 --> 00:00:37.924 position:63%
of these things are being used. That to me.

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:39.904 position:63%
That would be funny.

